# Flutter (mobile)

- API via `ApiClient`; use `--dart-define=API_BASE_URL=...` for device/LAN
- On HTTP 401: clear stored token and surface re-auth (do not keep stale JWT)
- Parse FastAPI `detail` into short user-facing text — never dump full JSON bodies in SnackBars
- `HomeShell`: two tabs — 故事 / 我的 (`IndexedStack`); create story is a pushed route
- Stories: open player only when `status == ready` and audio URL present; disable continue while `generating`
- After every `await`, guard with `if (!mounted) return` before `setState` / navigation
- Voice clone: `stop()` recorder before `dispose()` if still recording
